# Local Obsidian state (panel/tab layout): device-specific, avoids sync
# conflicts when the vault is synced across multiple devices (desktop/mobile).
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json

# Obsidian's internal trash
.trash/

# Local-only scratch space for material that must never be committed (real
# secrets/tokens captured during a case study, etc.) — never published. Kept
# as a safety net, but this content now belongs in the private rev-eng-art
# repo's <project>/captures/ instead of sitting here even gitignored.
**/local/

# Regenerable JS/TS tooling dependencies for scripts under a case study's
# source/ (e.g. a Frida+TypeScript setup) — reinstall with `npm install`
# from the matching package.json instead of committing them.
**/node_modules/
